  "title": "Domination log-concavity for the caterpillars T(p,0,0,q)",
  "batch_label": "85",
  "kind": "result-note",
  "original_status": "unresolved",
  "scope": "For every pair of integers p,q >= 1, let T(p,0,0,q) be the caterpillar with four spine vertices and respectively p,0,0,q attached leaves. The full coefficient sequence of its domination polynomial D_{T(p,0,0,q)}(x) is log-concave: d_j^2 >= d_{j-1}d_{j+1} for every 1 <= j <= p+q+3.",
